        <obo:IAO_0000115>A course is a generically dependent continuant that constitutes a structured educational program with a defined curriculum and is delivered by a higher education institution.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A formally cataloged academic unit with a unique identifier, title, and credit value offered by an institution.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>A course is a generically dependent continuant that constitutes a structured educational program with a defined curriculum and is delivered by a higher education institution.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Course</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label>course</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label>delivered by</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


